		(property "Description" "5 V in: JST PH 2-pin (2 A), SIDE entry, through-hole (owner 2026-10-31, was two solder holes; rev D: side entry, a top-entry plug + lead did not fit in front of the charger in the 64 mm housing). A short lead (AWG 24 max., PH crimps) from a solder-type USB-A plug in the USB charger plugs in here. Pin 2 = +5 V (USB VBUS), pin 1 = GND"
